   "image": "",
   "description": "Also known as TT13, Terror Town, or Beachside Terror, the gang is considered one of the most notorious Mexican-American gangs in Vespucci. Its main rivalries include PEN1 (Public Enemy No. 1), Asian Boyz (ABZ), School Yard Crips, and Naughty Nasty Crips. The gang developed a particularly hostile reputation toward Crip-affiliated sets following years of territorial disputes and retaliatory violence. Its alleged involvement in a mass shooting targeting ABZ members further cemented its notoriety, although no official charges were brought. As a Sureño-affiliated gang under the Mexican Mafia, Terror Town 13 maintains its identity through its Vespucci roots, longstanding neighborhood presence, and generational history."
